<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Excite downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Excite downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown says analyst Shaun Andrikopoulos lowered his recommendation on Excite Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst or details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 to 17 in late morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
